## Code Example
```javascript
function clamp(v, min, max){ return Math.max(min, Math.min(max, v)); }
function computeParams(ckne, base=1, alpha=2, minWindow=5, maxWindow=60, beta=0.5){
  const c = clamp(Math.round(base + alpha*ckne), 1, 8);
  const w = clamp(Math.round(minWindow + beta*(maxWindow-minWindow)*ckne), minWindow, maxWindow);
